      "content": "idk, it just feels like they're leaving a massive loophole for themselves. if they claim i \"memorized\" something, it's basically my word against their lawyers. is there any way to tighten this up in a counter-proposal? like, how can i define the boundary so it's clear what's just my general expertise and what's actually their IP?",
